Act I: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Shylock]
Prospero: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Polonius]
Prospero: You are as good as the difference between a big big big big big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Shylock and Polonius]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
Shylock: Are you better than nothing?
Polonius: If not, let us proceed to scene III.
Shylock: You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
Polonius: You are as good as the product of yourself and a big hero. Let us return to scene II.

